      {
        "title": "Local velocimetry for atomic superfluids: from Riemann rarefaction waves to quantized vortices",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.26608v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-11-19T18:56:37Z",
        "description": "We demonstrate local velocimetry for atomic superfluids in two dimensions (2D). Using matter-wave interferometry based on Raman--Bragg beam splitters, we map the local gradient of the phase of the superfluid's wavefunction onto displacement of the interference fringes and reconstruct the 2D velocity",
        "title_cn": "原子超流体的局部测速：从黎曼稀疏波到量子化涡旋"
      },
      {
        "title": "Query-Optimal Quantum Minimum Finding from Numerical Estimators",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.26606v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-11-19T18:55:55Z",
        "description": "We propose a quantum minimum-finding algorithm for objectives accessed via numerical estimators that avoids the logarithmic query overhead of amplifying the confidence of estimates before the search. A coherent estimator that is $\\varepsilon$-accurate with probability at least $2/3$ on each of $N$ l",
        "title_cn": "基于数值估计器的查询最优量子最小值查找"
      },
      {
        "title": "An Efficient Algorithm for Matroid Cups",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.26602v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-11-19T18:54:57Z",
        "description": "We design a polynomial-time algorithm for matroid cups with $O(1)$ discrepancy. Our matroid cups algorithm design consists of a sequence of reductions to simpler instances, culminating in $O(n)$ instances of matroid cups where the matroid has rank 1.",
        "title_cn": "一种用于拟阵并的有效算法"
      },
      {
