        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.26601v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-11-19T18:54:19Z",
        "description": "LLM-based agents are becoming increasingly capable at discovering, validating and patching vulnerabilities in real software, and vendors and researchers report that this is already changing how vulnerabilities are found and fixed. These claims, however, are scattered across papers, vendor reports an",
        "title_cn": "SoK：评估大语言模型（LLM）在软件漏洞研究中的能力演变"
      },
      {
        "title": "Susceptibility source separation via Closed-form Alternating Newton-type Optimization",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.26561v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-11-19T18:27:29Z",
        "description": "Quantitative Susceptibility Mapping (QSM) provides a bulk magnetic susceptibility estimate per voxel, so contributions from paramagnetic and diamagnetic sources within the same voxel partially cancel. Susceptibility source separation methods identify these compartments by fitting a three-pool comple",
        "title_cn": "通过闭式交替牛顿型优化进行磁化率源分离"
      },
      {
        "title": "Superluminal propagation in the magnetic NED reconstruction of the extremal Dymnikova black hole",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.26560v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-11-19T18:27:24Z",
        "description": "We reconstruct the magnetic nonlinear electrodynamics (NED) source of the Dymnikova geometry on the branch \\(\\Iinv>0\\) and analyze its electromagnetic perturbations on the fixed background. The reconstruction does not admit a Maxwell limit. The extraordinary characteristic cone gives a transverse sp",
        "title_cn": "极值Dymnikova黑洞的磁性NED重构中的超光速传播"
      },
      {
        "title": "Chemical Cartography Across Time: The Age-Dependent Chemical Structure of the Milky Way with a Homogeneous Sample of 580,000 Giants from Five Surveys",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.26550v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-11-19T18:22:30Z",
        "description": "Mapping the distribution of elements in the Milky Way and understanding how that distribution has changed over time can give us insight into the formation and evolution of our Galaxy. Here we use homogeneously estimated atmospheric parameters, elemental abundances, distances, and ages for ~580,000 g",
        "title_cn": "跨越时间的化学制图：来自五项巡天的580,000颗巨星的同质样本揭示的银河系随年龄变化的化学结构"
      },
      {
        "title": "Demographic inference in exoplanet chemistry is shaped by retrieval assumptions",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.26548v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-11-19T18:20:48Z",
        "description": "Understanding the chemical diversity of exoplanet atmospheres is crucial for linking atmospheric composition to planetary formation history. Atmospheric C/O can provide clues about where and how planets form, particularly through the accretion of gas and solids across disk snowlines. Since planetary",
        "title_cn": "系外行星化学中的人口统计推断受反演假设的影响"
      },
      {
        "title": "Nonlinearly Causal General-Relativistic Superfluid Hydrodynamics: Simulating Vortex Dynamics in Neutron-Star Interiors",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.26547v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-11-19T18:20:33Z",
        "description": "Neutron stars provide a natural laboratory for superfluid matter under extreme conditions. Its nonlinear dynamics is central to pulsar glitches, their possible links to fast radio bursts, and tidal interactions in inspiralling binaries. We develop a general-relativistic superfluid hydrodynamics fram",
        "title_cn": "非线性因果广义相对论超流体流体力学：模拟中子星内部的涡旋动力学"
      },
      {
        "title": "Outflow Properties from a Broad Range of GR$ν$RMHD Stellar-Mass Black Hole Accretion Disks",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.26534v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-11-19T18:15:42Z",
        "description": "The majority of the mass ejected by neutron star mergers comes from accretion disk outflows. Over timescales of seconds, the thermodynamic evolution of the disk and its resultant outflows set the stage for the ejecta properties which manifest in kilonova observations at later times (hours/days). Kil",
        "title_cn": "来自广泛GR$ν$RMHD恒星质量黑洞吸积盘的流出特性"
      }
